{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is visible, go to it. Then check its properties, pick it up and perform specific task. list of available nodes: <Action ID = GoToObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectWeight    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectSize    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectShape    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectColor    /> <Action ID = PickUpObject    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    />  <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectGrabbed    />",
